        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hey, folks. Didn&#39;t know if everyone else already knew this, but I just figured it out and wanted to share.  :slightly_smiling_face: \n\nAt Gen Con, some folks commented about typos and other errors in both the Enhanced Edition and Infernal Relics rulebooks. It turns out that <a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/downloads\">the online versions</a> are actually updated with the corrections!  :open_mouth:  That&#39;s shiny!\n\nI&#39;ve printed out versions for my travel box, so I have extras without the errors (although I&#39;ll admit we rarely refer to the rulebook except when teaching new folks how to play  :blush: ).",
